Theory (ICML round): the trapped engine as an overloaded re-entrant FIFO queue; frozen conditional predictions

Theorem 1 (notes/THEORY_ICML_2026-11.md, in progress): along FIFO orbits the trapped engine's cycle obeys the renewal
recursion Delta_n = sum_k lambda c_k G_k Delta_{n-k}; its Perron root z gives the cycle growth gamma = z - 1, the backlog
growth alpha = lambda (1 - E z^-T), the trapped completion rate lambda E z^-T > lambda_miss and the z-tilted turn mix.

